], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DANGER: ELECTRIC SHOCK", "keywords": [], "long_description": "{\u904a\u6232\u8aaa\u660e}\n\n\u76ee\u6a19\n\u624b\u6301\u96fb\u6d41\u6025\u6025\u68d2\u7a7f\u904e\u901a\u96fb\u9053\u4e26\u62b5\u9054\u7d42\u9ede\u7dda\u3002\n\n\u901a\u96fb\u9053\n\u7531\u901a\u4e0a\u96fb\u6d41\u7684\u91d1\u5c6c\u6846\u7d44\u6210\u3002\n\n\u904a\u6232\u73a9\u6cd5\n\u63a7\u5236\u96fb\u6d41\u6025\u6025\u68d2\uff0c\u5207\u52ff\u78b0\u89f8\u91d1\u5c6c\u6846\u3002\n\n\u5099\u8a3b\n\u5728\u9014\u4e2d\u63a8\u62c9\u96fb\u6d41\u6025\u6025\u68d2\u4ee5\u8df3\u904e\u969c\u7919\u5c31\u7b97\u8f38\u3002", "short_description": "\u9583\u907f\u5371\u96aa\u9677\u9631\u4e26\u5b8c\u6210\u6b64\u904a\u6232\uff01\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "954690198815109", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DANGER: ELECTRIC SHOCK", "keywords": [], "long_description": "{\u6e38\u620f\u8bf4\u660e}\n\n\u76ee\u6807\n\u5e26\u7740\u4e00\u6839\u68d2\u5b50\u7a7f\u8fc7\u4e00\u6761\u901a\u9053\uff0c\u5230\u8fbe\u7ec8\u70b9\u7ebf\u3002\n\n\u901a\u9053\n\u7528\u91d1\u5c5e\u6846\u505a\u6210\uff0c\u91d1\u5c5e\u6846\u4e2d\u6709\u7535\u6d41\u6d41\u52a8\u3002\n\n\u6e38\u620f\u73a9\u6cd5\n\u63a7\u5236\u68d2\u5b50\uff0c\u4f7f\u5176\u4e0d\u78b0\u5230\u91d1\u5c5e\u6846\u3002\n\n\u6ce8\u610f\u4e8b\u9879\n\u5982\u679c\u60a8\u63a8\u62c9\u68d2\u5b50\u4e2d\u9014\u8df3\u8fc7\uff0c\u5219\u6e38\u620f\u7ed3\u675f\u3002", "short_description": "\u907f\u5f00\u5371\u9669\u7684\u9677\u9631\uff0c\u5b8c\u6210\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "639922570772092", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DANGER: ELECTRIC SHOCK", "keywords": [], "long_description": "{Instructions de jeu}\n\nBut:\nSuivez un parcours jusqu'\u00e0 la ligne d'arriv\u00e9e avec une tige.\n\nParcours:\nCompos\u00e9 d'armatures en m\u00e9tal dans lesquelles passe un courant \u00e9lectrique.\n\nD\u00e9roulement du jeu:\nContr\u00f4lez la tige pour ne pas toucher les cadres m\u00e9talliques.\n\nRemarque:\nSi vous poussez ou tirez la tige afin de sauter le milieu des parcours, la partie est termin\u00e9e.", "short_description": "\u00c9vitez les pi\u00e8ges dangereux et terminez ce jeu !"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1869809403214014", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001707_1869809406547347_6887606735657821599_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zG6XvWw_ifsQ7kNvwELl3ZN&_nc_oc=Adr7oD9vG9Qp8MBIOHBu59Hf18p27TLapcD98ctQLZznALumIUXql5zl36HehTVPZzo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WTQoVCVjM2ZrQEyc---0eG-9JzwMOOo_ulYwafLJc2w&oe=6A26CEFA"}, {"file_name": "seihoukei_cover.png", "id": "1578026155878263", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036700_1578026159211596_338271830850509098_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oqMOdMlgVDAQ7kNvwF8ixUq&_nc_oc=Adr2jMBf0HGVzskI4pB3z3Pewm6ECgO7vUnSZSYTLZzwkeDUXul3dSeZKS6AGorjcJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97Tq6bZVn848RdKR0xivILqYMeR3aAVLQLuxOQxi2v0A&oe=6A26BE8C"}, {"file_name": "yokonaga_cover.png", "id": "1240561843078098", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395601_1240561846411431_4887466305539088189_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VAonQCBbEH8Q7kNvwENvlBQ&_nc_oc=AdpCTjw5Re-PJg2bzdId4GFphH4tqPQOWzYXo8MGVmmtDDIkrCGbhyx0tlHUjv6VztU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9sNl-3AM8PT601lUTYVEwuQ4JdtFn3316Ib4A1FJaZ4Q&oe=6A26E33E"}, {"file_name": "yokonaga_cover_mini.png", "id": "930274564509275", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982691_9302745